'''Empress' Excavation 1''' (女王の発掘調査１, ''Joō no Hakkutsu Chōsa 1'', '''Queen's Excavation 1''') is one of the maps unlocked after clearing [[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]], and has several one-time rewards including [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N001]]. Just like the series of [[Empress' Research]] maps, it has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Once completed, the player will unlock [[Empress' Excavation 2]], which drops another [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N003]]. This event was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]].

